# Reports Dashboard Components Directory

This directory contains all React components for the Department Reports Dashboard feature.

## Structure:
- Analytics/ - Analytics dashboard components (metrics cards, quick insights)
- Charts/ - Chart components (performance distribution, trends, comparisons)
- DataQuality/ - Data quality monitoring components
- Export/ - Export controls and related components
- Filters/ - Filter panel and filter-related components
- Rankings/ - Teacher ranking tables and components
- Shared/ - Shared/reusable components across the Reports feature
